[
{
"content_id": "700392",
"reference_id": 203329,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "好消息",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "好消息",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>使徒以特定的順序分享了關於耶穌的好消息（或稱「福音」），包括以下部分：</p><ol><li><p>舊約聖經的應許，透過耶穌基督的生命、死亡和復活而實現。</p></li><li><p>神藉著使耶穌從死裡復活，高舉耶穌成為神新子民的領袖，即神所揀選的彌賽亞。</p></li><li><p>使徒見證神在耶穌基督身上的工作。他們看到祂的公開事奉和復活（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44002032\" data-end-ref=\"44002032\">徒2:32</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44003015\" data-end-ref=\"44003015\">3:15</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44004033\" data-end-ref=\"44004033\">4:33</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44005030\" data-end-ref=\"44005032\">5:30–32</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013030\" data-end-ref=\"44013031\">13:30–31</data>）。他們是祂揀選的使者（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010039\" data-end-ref=\"44010043\">10:39–43</data>）。</p></li><li><p>對這個好消息的正確回應，是悔改（遠離罪）並信靠耶穌（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44002038\" data-end-ref=\"44002038\">徒2:38</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44003019\" data-end-ref=\"44003019\">3:19</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013039\" data-end-ref=\"44013039\">13:39</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013048\" data-end-ref=\"44013048\">48</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44017030\" data-end-ref=\"44017030\">17:30</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44020021\" data-end-ref=\"44020021\">20:21</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44026020\" data-end-ref=\"44026020\">26:20</data>）。</p></li><li><p>神應許將聖靈賜給那些藉耶穌基督，接受神的赦免，並從罪中得到拯救的人。</p></li></ol><p>使徒經常與地中海地區的猶太人和非猶太人（稱為外邦人）分享這個基本信息（見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44001008\" data-end-ref=\"44001008\">徒1:8</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44009015\" data-end-ref=\"44009015\">9:15</data>），可以在彼得和腓利的講論中聽見（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44002014\" data-end-ref=\"44002041\">2:14–41</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44003012\" data-end-ref=\"44003026\">3:12–26</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44004008\" data-end-ref=\"44004012\">4:8–12</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44005029\" data-end-ref=\"44005032\">5:29–32</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44008004\" data-end-ref=\"44008013\">8:4–13</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44008026\" data-end-ref=\"44008040\">26–40</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010034\" data-end-ref=\"44010043\">10:34–43</data>）。保羅的講道也包含這些主題（例如，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013016\" data-end-ref=\"44013049\">徒13:16–49</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46015001\" data-end-ref=\"46015011\">林前15:1–11</data>）。</p><p>這個關於神拯救恩典的有力信息，改變了人們的意志和心靈去順服祂。接受這個信息是邁向救恩的第一步。神呼召所有人從罪中悔改，並信靠耶穌的拯救力量（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44004012\" data-end-ref=\"44004012\">徒4:12</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013038\" data-end-ref=\"44013038\">13:38</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44016030\" data-end-ref=\"44016031\">16:30–31</data>）。藉著耶穌，神持續使那些繼續信靠祂的人，與祂和好（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013039\" data-end-ref=\"44013039\">13:39</data>）。</p><p><u>進深研究的經文段落</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40004023\" data-end-ref=\"40004024\">太4:23–24</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024014\" data-end-ref=\"40024014\">24:14</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41001001\" data-end-ref=\"41001001\">可1:1</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41001014\" data-end-ref=\"41001015\">14–15</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42004018\" data-end-ref=\"42004021\">路4:18–21</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44002014\" data-end-ref=\"44002040\">徒2:14–40</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44003012\" data-end-ref=\"44003026\">3:12–26</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44008025\" data-end-ref=\"44008040\">8:25–40</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010034\" data-end-ref=\"44010043\">10:34–43</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44013016\" data-end-ref=\"44013041\">13:16–41</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44016031\" data-end-ref=\"44016031\">16:31</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44017016\" data-end-ref=\"44017031\">17:16–31</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44020021\" data-end-ref=\"44020021\">20:21</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45001001\" data-end-ref=\"45001005\">羅1:1–5</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45001015\" data-end-ref=\"45001017\">15–17</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45010015\" data-end-ref=\"45010017\">10:15–17</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45016025\" data-end-ref=\"45016027\">16:25–27；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46001018\" data-end-ref=\"46001018\">林前1:18</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46015003\" data-end-ref=\"46015008\">15:3–8</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47004003\" data-end-ref=\"47004007\">林後4:3–7</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49001013\" data-end-ref=\"49001013\">弗1:13</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49002004\" data-end-ref=\"49002018\">2:4–18</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"53002013\" data-end-ref=\"53002014\">帖後2:13–14</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"55001009\" data-end-ref=\"55001010\">提後1:9–10</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"55002008\" data-end-ref=\"55002013\">2:8–13</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58004001\" data-end-ref=\"58004016\">來4:1–16</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60001003\" data-end-ref=\"60001012\">彼前1:3–12</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66014006\" data-end-ref=\"66014007\">啟14:6–7</data></p>",
